msgid "network-manager interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/network-manager-interface.md:10
msgid ""
"`network-manager` enables access to [NetworkManager](https://docs.ubuntu.com/"
"core/en/stacks/network/network-manager/docs/), providing privileged access "
"to configure and observe networking."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/network-manager-interface.md:12
msgid "**Auto-connect**: no"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/network-manager-interface.md:15
msgid ""
"The `network-manager` slot is {ref}`unsupported for parallel instances "
"<interfaces-parallel-installs-unsupported>`. The slot owns a unique system-"
"wide resource that instances would conflict over."
msgstr ""
